{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>英偉達董事會11月8日宣佈，將針對有關行政總裁黃仁勳個人關聯事項的指控啓動獨立調查。受相關風波影響，黃仁勳的去留成為市場焦點。當地時間9日，英偉達股價走低，最終收跌4.27%，報每股178.67美元，市值縮水約1930億美元（約合人民幣12882億元）。而在美股收盤五分鐘後，英偉達及黃仁勳便遭到股東集體訴訟，指控其涉嫌欺詐股東。</p>\n<h2>最新資訊</h2>\n<h2>編輯精選</h2>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>熱門評論</h3>\n<h3>相關文章</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>Top 10</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.417251+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:19:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:39.604328+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:03.513509+00:00","content_hash":"b52772bcd47eebb19b3f51fb385cc3e83653c7920ed53374444d210eedddd4ae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.417251+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}